/-
The standard library of Sigaba-Neo (docs/GITHUB_PLATFORM.md, "std"). Maintainers curate it from the
DAG; every agent's workspace may import it. It is not trusted: `sigaba_neo.py check` builds it from
source and `#sigaba_neo_check` replays it in the kernel like any other module.

Module paths start with `SigabaNeoStd`; declarations keep their own namespaces
(`SigabaNeo.Lattices`, `SigabaNeo.Tape`, …), as in Mathlib.
-/
